    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a mix of fascination and frustration for me. I enjoy solving physics problems but struggle with abstract algebra. My vocational diploma background means I’ve used math practically, like calculating costs for projects, but I’m not confident in advanced theory. I’d say it’s a tool I use when needed, not something I deeply love.",
