    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I used a free AI tool last month to check my calculus homework. It explained derivatives step by step, which helped me understand where I went wrong. However, the explanations were too simplistic for advanced topics like differential equations. Overall, it was useful but not perfect for my level.",
